# Other phrasings of history comments: state the reason (WHY) in the present tense, keep history in commits and issues (conventions §7.5, 7.6) — wordings that slip past no-history-comment
description=No history narration ("종전에는" / "(에서|으로|로) 옮겼다", i.e. "previously" / "moved from/to") in code comments and docstrings
paths=src/,scripts/,skills/,plugins/,.github/scripts/
extensions=.js,.mjs,.py
# stealth.py: credits the external code (gstack) it was ported from — attribution, not history
exclude=skills/pro-launch/scripts/stealth.py
pattern=종전에는|(에서|으로|로) 옮겼다
